<h2>Kelompok ricikan</h2>
Kelompok ricikan.
Ricikan &lt;a href="gamelan"&gt;gamelan&lt;/a&gt; bisa dikelompokake dados 4 pérangan inggih menika:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Gongan"&gt;Gongan&lt;/a&gt;: kempyang, kethuk, kempul, kenong lan gong</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Balungan"&gt;Balungan&lt;/a&gt;: saron panerus, saron barung, demung, slenthem lan slentho</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Panerusan"&gt;Panerusan&lt;/a&gt;: bonang, gendér, gambang, siter, celempung, suling lan rebab</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Kendhang"&gt;Kendhang&lt;/a&gt;: kendhang lan bedhug.</li>
</ul>
