<li>&lt;a href="Kakawin%20Bharatayuddha"&gt;Kakawin Bharatayuddha&lt;/a&gt; digubah déning &lt;a href="Mpu%20Sedah"&gt;Mpu Sedah&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mpu%20Panuluh"&gt;Mpu Panuluh&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
